WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.291 --> 00:00:33.083
In the previous verse, Lord Krishna explained

2
00:00:33.083 --> 00:00:36.625
that those people who don't come to
 His shelter with complete surrender,

3
00:00:36.625 --> 00:00:39.625
Lord Krishna's true form isn't visible to them

4
00:00:39.625 --> 00:00:42.500
because of māyā's veil.

5
00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:44.375
A natural question may arise

6
00:00:44.375 --> 00:00:46.250
in someone's mind –

7
00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:49.458
if there's a veil in between, a curtain,

8
00:00:49.458 --> 00:00:50.458
then because of

9
00:00:50.458 --> 00:00:51.125
this obstacle in between,

10
00:00:51.125 --> 00:00:55.041
aren't those people visible
 to Lord Krishna either?

11
00:00:55.041 --> 00:00:56.666
In this verse, Lord Krishna

12
00:00:56.666 --> 00:00:58.250
is giving the answer

13
00:00:58.250 --> 00:01:01.625
that māyā can cover jīvātmās' understanding,

14
00:01:01.625 --> 00:01:05.416
but its effect doesn't fall on Lord Krishna.

15
00:01:10.041 --> 00:01:12.375
'Vedāhaṁ samatītāni

16
00:01:12.375 --> 00:01:14.958
vartamānāni cārjuna' –

17
00:01:14.958 --> 00:01:17.125
Lord Krishna begins this verse

18
00:01:17.125 --> 00:01:20.333
with these words, whose meaning is,

19
00:01:20.333 --> 00:01:24.000
'I know the past, the present,

20
00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:29.041
and the coming future – everything.'

21
00:01:29.041 --> 00:01:32.041
This shows Lord Krishna's omniscience.

22
00:01:32.041 --> 00:01:33.500
He is trikāladarśī –

23
00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:36.875
and is aware of all events.

24
00:01:36.875 --> 00:01:41.083
Ahead He says, 'Bhaviṣyāṇi ca bhūtāni,'

25
00:01:41.083 --> 00:01:43.708
meaning 'I know the future

26
00:01:43.708 --> 00:01:46.708
and all beings.'

27
00:01:46.708 --> 00:01:48.750
Lord Krishna's knowledge

28
00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:51.833
isn't limited to time and circumstances.

29
00:01:51.833 --> 00:01:54.208
Then Lord Krishna also says,

30
00:01:54.208 --> 00:01:57.208
'Mām tu veda na kaścana,'

31
00:01:57.208 --> 00:02:02.333
'But no one knows Me completely.'

32
00:02:02.333 --> 00:02:04.875
This tells that although

33
00:02:04.875 --> 00:02:05.875
Lord Krishna

34
00:02:05.875 --> 00:02:08.250
knows the events of three times –

35
00:02:08.250 --> 00:02:10.166
knows all beings' past,

36
00:02:10.166 --> 00:02:13.000
present, and future,

37
00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:15.458
but understanding Lord Krishna completely

38
00:02:15.458 --> 00:02:16.583
isn't possible

39
00:02:16.583 --> 00:02:19.166
for any person.

40
00:02:19.166 --> 00:02:21.833
Whether they're some great deity

41
00:02:21.833 --> 00:02:25.000
or a yogi accomplished in
 knowledge and austerity.

42
00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:25.625
Lord Krishna

43
00:02:25.625 --> 00:02:29.083
is beyond the understanding of all these.

44
00:02:29.083 --> 00:02:31.625
As we learned in the previous verse,

45
00:02:31.625 --> 00:02:33.416
Lord Krishna through māyā

46
00:02:33.416 --> 00:02:36.416
keeps His real form unmanifest.

47
00:02:36.416 --> 00:02:39.791
And māyā, being itself a form

48
00:02:39.791 --> 00:02:41.666
of Lord Krishna's power,

49
00:02:41.666 --> 00:02:43.875
can never affect

50
00:02:43.875 --> 00:02:45.208
Lord Krishna's vision.

51
00:02:45.208 --> 00:02:46.958
Rather, this power is

52
00:02:46.958 --> 00:02:49.125
under Lord Krishna Himself

53
00:02:49.125 --> 00:02:51.666
and functions according

54
00:02:51.666 --> 00:02:52.791
to His approval.

55
00:02:52.791 --> 00:02:56.500
Understand it like this – this is one-way glass –

56
00:02:56.500 --> 00:02:59.250
through which Lord Krishna can see all beings,

57
00:02:59.250 --> 00:03:03.125
their past, present, and future,

58
00:03:03.125 --> 00:03:08.041
but those beings cannot see Lord Krishna.

59
00:03:12.958 --> 00:03:15.125
Imagine

60
00:03:15.125 --> 00:03:17.458
that you're living your life

61
00:03:17.458 --> 00:03:20.375
with this belief

62
00:03:20.375 --> 00:03:24.208
that someone is always with you –

63
00:03:24.208 --> 00:03:27.416
who knows not only your present,

64
00:03:27.416 --> 00:03:31.333
but your past and future too.

65
00:03:31.333 --> 00:03:35.333
Who recognizes you completely from within

66
00:03:35.333 --> 00:03:37.875
and is always

67
00:03:37.875 --> 00:03:43.125
working for your welfare and good.

68
00:03:43.125 --> 00:03:45.041
Understand My existence

69
00:03:45.041 --> 00:03:48.875
in your life like this.

70
00:03:48.875 --> 00:03:52.875
I'm aware of every event of your life –

71
00:03:52.875 --> 00:03:56.125
what has passed, what's happening,

72
00:03:56.125 --> 00:03:58.708
and what's going to happen.

73
00:03:58.708 --> 00:04:00.708
And in all these,

74
00:04:00.708 --> 00:04:05.416
I'm always guiding you

75
00:04:05.416 --> 00:04:08.333
with love and affection.

76
00:04:08.333 --> 00:04:11.166
Understand it like this –

77
00:04:11.166 --> 00:04:13.125
just as a sculptor

78
00:04:13.125 --> 00:04:17.791
slowly gives shape to their creation,

79
00:04:17.791 --> 00:04:23.083
I too am giving your life the right form,

80
00:04:23.083 --> 00:04:27.000
taking it in the right direction.

81
00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:30.000
Sometimes life seems difficult,

82
00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:31.333
when the present

83
00:04:31.333 --> 00:04:35.166
isn't according to your expectations.

84
00:04:35.166 --> 00:04:38.375
The question arises in the mind,

85
00:04:38.375 --> 00:04:42.833
'Why is all this happening to me?'

86
00:04:42.833 --> 00:04:44.833
But remember,

87
00:04:44.833 --> 00:04:48.625
just as a sculptor knows

88
00:04:48.625 --> 00:04:52.541
in what form to carve the stone,

89
00:04:52.541 --> 00:04:55.833
I also know

90
00:04:55.833 --> 00:04:59.458
what you're becoming.

91
00:04:59.458 --> 00:05:01.375
I can clearly see

92
00:05:01.375 --> 00:05:04.750
your bright future

93
00:05:04.750 --> 00:05:08.583
and know which lesson is necessary

94
00:05:08.583 --> 00:05:11.291
today in your life,

95
00:05:11.291 --> 00:05:14.250
which events are necessary,

96
00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:20.208
which will take you to your best form.

97
00:05:20.208 --> 00:05:25.041
You're in safe hands.

98
00:05:25.041 --> 00:05:26.208
If the present

99
00:05:26.208 --> 00:05:29.666
is difficult, then have patience.

100
00:05:29.666 --> 00:05:34.625
Remember this – all this is happening

101
00:05:34.625 --> 00:05:36.916
not to you,

102
00:05:36.916 --> 00:05:40.208
but for you – so you can go in the right direction.

103
00:05:40.208 --> 00:05:42.333
And yes,

104
00:05:42.333 --> 00:05:45.250
when you achieve some success,

105
00:05:45.250 --> 00:05:50.125
when you make some decision very wisely,

106
00:05:50.125 --> 00:05:52.666
then definitely look

107
00:05:52.666 --> 00:05:55.791
at your past once.

108
00:05:55.791 --> 00:05:58.916
You'll know that some difficulties

109
00:05:58.916 --> 00:06:03.750
that came in the past
 have given you this wisdom,

110
00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:06.458
and that very wisdom is today

111
00:06:06.458 --> 00:06:09.333
the source of your success.

112
00:06:09.333 --> 00:06:11.791
So just don't be scared

113
00:06:11.791 --> 00:06:15.083
of today's difficulty either.

114
00:06:15.083 --> 00:06:19.041
Learn something from it and move forward.

115
00:06:19.041 --> 00:06:22.125
A stone gets hit,

116
00:06:22.125 --> 00:06:23.333
then

117
00:06:23.333 --> 00:06:26.833
a beautiful statue is born.

118
00:06:26.833 --> 00:06:29.458
Difficulties are also giving you

119
00:06:29.458 --> 00:06:32.458
a beautiful form in the same way.

120
00:06:32.458 --> 00:06:37.375
Just keep your faith in Me.

121
00:06:37.375 --> 00:06:40.833
And keep walking on this path of the Gita.

122
00:06:40.833 --> 00:06:43.500
After some time, you yourself

123
00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:46.375
will start remaining calm in difficulties,

124
00:06:46.375 --> 00:06:49.708
will start learning from them, and will know

125
00:06:49.708 --> 00:06:54.375
that whatever is happening with you in life

126
00:06:54.375 --> 00:06:59.250
is for your good only.

127
00:07:04.041 --> 00:07:06.750
I know your past,

128
00:07:06.750 --> 00:07:12.083
present, and future – all.

129
00:07:12.083 --> 00:07:17.208
Similarly, I also know your children's life

130
00:07:17.208 --> 00:07:21.333
very well.

131
00:07:21.333 --> 00:07:24.625
As parents, it's natural

132
00:07:24.625 --> 00:07:25.375
that you'll

133
00:07:25.375 --> 00:07:30.000
be worried about your children's future.

134
00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:34.916
You'll want them to be successful, remain happy,

135
00:07:34.916 --> 00:07:38.791
and live a purposeful life.

136
00:07:38.791 --> 00:07:42.083
But just by remaining worried,

137
00:07:42.083 --> 00:07:46.541
your children's future won't be secured.

138
00:07:46.541 --> 00:07:49.708
To secure their future,

139
00:07:49.708 --> 00:07:55.583
you'll have to focus on their present.

140
00:07:55.583 --> 00:07:59.666
You cannot control every circumstance,

141
00:07:59.666 --> 00:08:01.125
cannot save your children

142
00:08:01.125 --> 00:08:06.083
from every challenge either, but

143
00:08:06.083 --> 00:08:10.375
you can awaken that self-confidence in them

144
00:08:10.375 --> 00:08:14.875
through which they become capable of facing

145
00:08:14.875 --> 00:08:17.375
their life's problems themselves.

146
00:08:17.375 --> 00:08:19.666
And for this,

147
00:08:19.666 --> 00:08:22.541
you can give them a very

148
00:08:22.541 --> 00:08:27.375
valuable gift –

149
00:08:27.375 --> 00:08:29.666
this knowledge of the Gita.

150
00:08:29.666 --> 00:08:32.625
Which will be effective in building

151
00:08:32.625 --> 00:08:35.250
a strong foundation of humility

152
00:08:35.250 --> 00:08:39.500
and good character for their bright future.

153
00:08:39.500 --> 00:08:41.125
In difficult circumstances,

154
00:08:41.125 --> 00:08:44.666
this Gita will become their helper.

155
00:08:44.666 --> 00:08:47.958
Always assure them also

156
00:08:47.958 --> 00:08:49.916
that in every circumstance

157
00:08:49.916 --> 00:08:53.041
you stand for their support.

158
00:08:53.041 --> 00:08:55.208
Along with this,

159
00:08:55.208 --> 00:08:56.750
also inspire them

160
00:08:56.750 --> 00:09:00.291
for surrender to Me.

161
00:09:00.291 --> 00:09:03.166
From this, this faith will also awaken in them

162
00:09:03.166 --> 00:09:07.166
that in every circumstance, I Myself

163
00:09:07.166 --> 00:09:09.125
stand for their help

164
00:09:09.125 --> 00:09:12.000
as their well-wisher.

165
00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:13.833
Now think –

166
00:09:13.833 --> 00:09:15.625
if they have

167
00:09:15.625 --> 00:09:19.791
the power of humility and character,

168
00:09:19.791 --> 00:09:24.416
and in difficult circumstances
 they have your support,

169
00:09:24.416 --> 00:09:28.083
they have faith toward Me within them,

170
00:09:28.083 --> 00:09:30.500
then no challenge

171
00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:32.708
will be able to defeat them.

172
00:09:37.416 --> 00:09:39.958
The meaning of good leadership isn't only

173
00:09:39.958 --> 00:09:41.750
making decisions for

174
00:09:41.750 --> 00:09:45.000
present circumstances, but making such

175
00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:48.833
decisions that can change the future.

176
00:09:48.833 --> 00:09:50.208
For this reason,

177
00:09:50.208 --> 00:09:53.416
foresight is extremely important

178
00:09:53.416 --> 00:09:56.000
in professional life.

179
00:09:56.000 --> 00:09:59.125
I know your past,

180
00:09:59.125 --> 00:10:03.291
know the present, and know the future too.

181
00:10:03.291 --> 00:10:07.333
Similarly, for appropriate
 professional leadership,

182
00:10:07.333 --> 00:10:08.750
it's necessary

183
00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:12.041
that you also know about people

184
00:10:12.041 --> 00:10:14.666
working with you.

185
00:10:14.666 --> 00:10:16.916
For example,

186
00:10:16.916 --> 00:10:18.625
know what's

187
00:10:18.625 --> 00:10:21.750
important for them,

188
00:10:21.750 --> 00:10:24.708
is there some trouble

189
00:10:24.708 --> 00:10:26.000
going on at their home,

190
00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:28.791
what motivates them.

191
00:10:28.791 --> 00:10:31.250
And for this, what's necessary

192
00:10:31.250 --> 00:10:35.041
is being their well-wisher from true heart.

193
00:10:35.041 --> 00:10:37.625
This is just as

194
00:10:37.625 --> 00:10:40.750
I am your well-wisher.

195
00:10:40.750 --> 00:10:43.625
When you understand your colleagues

196
00:10:43.625 --> 00:10:46.250
like a well-wisher,

197
00:10:46.250 --> 00:10:49.833
then you'll understand their circumstances,
 their capabilities,

198
00:10:49.833 --> 00:10:51.208
their weaknesses,

199
00:10:51.208 --> 00:10:54.916
and their motivations, and
 keeping them in mind,

200
00:10:54.916 --> 00:10:58.583
you'll be able to give them right guidance.

201
00:10:58.583 --> 00:11:02.875
Along with this, if you're
 in a leadership position,

202
00:11:02.875 --> 00:11:04.833
then it's also necessary

203
00:11:04.833 --> 00:11:08.000
that instead of solving colleagues' 

204
00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:10.666
professional problems yourself,

205
00:11:10.666 --> 00:11:13.208
you encourage them

206
00:11:13.208 --> 00:11:16.708
to find their solution themselves.

207
00:11:16.708 --> 00:11:22.583
They may get a little irritated, think wrong of you

208
00:11:22.583 --> 00:11:27.750
that 'Why aren't you giving the
 solution to their problem?'

209
00:11:27.750 --> 00:11:29.125
But

210
00:11:29.125 --> 00:11:31.958
this is good for them.

211
00:11:31.958 --> 00:11:35.750
Because instead of depending on you,

212
00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:36.875
they'll gain the capability

213
00:11:36.875 --> 00:11:39.541
to face problems themselves.

214
00:11:39.541 --> 00:11:42.916
Do you now understand

215
00:11:42.916 --> 00:11:47.958
that I also do the same with you?

216
00:11:47.958 --> 00:11:49.500
Yes,

217
00:11:49.500 --> 00:11:53.125
Because I'm your well-wisher,

218
00:11:53.125 --> 00:11:57.000
I wish for your bright future.

219
00:11:57.000 --> 00:12:01.041
But also keep this faith

220
00:12:01.041 --> 00:12:05.875
that I'll never let you break.

221
00:12:05.875 --> 00:12:08.125
I'll handle you.

222
00:12:08.125 --> 00:12:11.375
People working with you should also have

223
00:12:11.375 --> 00:12:15.125
this very faith in you.

224
00:12:15.125 --> 00:12:19.583
The core mantra of leadership is – this trust.

225
00:12:19.583 --> 00:12:22.958
Don't let it break.
